Pasqal QDMI Device: licensing status

Copyright (c) 2026 Munich Quantum Software Company GmbH

New files explicitly marked SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH
LLVM-exception are offered under that license. Its exact text is included in
licenses/LICENSE-APACHE2-LLVM. This statement does not relicense inherited work.

The supplied qdmi-pasqal-0.2.0-src.tar.gz archive did not contain a root license
or a complete authorship/license declaration. Two files carry inherited QDMI
Maintainers notices under Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; these notices remain
in place. Most original implementation files have no license declaration.
Their redistribution permission has not been established by the archive.

Consequently this repository must remain private and must not be publicly
released until the rights holders provide the missing provenance and license
evidence. No license for the entire inherited draft is asserted here.

See NOTICE for the available attribution evidence and third-party notices.
